OL,3,A'Absolutely blown away': First visitors
OL,4,Asee Bayeux Tapestry as London
OL,5,Aexhibition opens
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bayeux Tapestry has gone on public
OL,8,Fdisplay in the UK for the first time
OL,9,Fsince it was created nearly 1,000 years
OL,10,Fago
OL,12,F"I was absolutely blown away by it,"
OL,13,Fone of the first viewers of the sold
OL,14,Fout exhibit says. Didn't get a ticket?
OL,15,FHere's how you can view the tapestry
OL,17,FThe loan of the 70m (230ft) tapestry
OL,18,Fhas been almost 100 years in the
OL,19,Fmaking, and has faced some vocal
OL,20,Fopposition in France
